+        // SCRATCH (t0-gumm, never commit to src): with TERTIUS_X_OWNRAY_LOG=<folder>, each draw first reads the own-ray lists
+        // that the draw before it wrote, and appends "<that draw's frame number> <its draw index> <width> <height>
